   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "I had my haircut with Phoenix today, and it was such a great experience. I'm so happy with the result!\n\nShe was incredibly friendly and professional. She checked with me at every stage to make sure I was happy before making any changes, and he paid so much attention to every detail.\n\nI'm genuinely so pleased with my new haircut—it turned out exactly the way I wanted. Thank you so much!",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
