  {
   "name": "places/ChIJ1yI8ILyxe0gRBzw1ke3pKr4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taTmRYSlNXRWswUlhKalZtUmtSVEpYUlVWbmFHYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "Such a good experience! I’ve been on the hunt for a new hairdresser after relocating to Manchester and I’m so glad I went with Vox. I even got 10% off for being a new customer.\n\nEveryone was so lovely and Amy did a great job and was super friendly. She kept checking in that the cut was still looking how I wanted which doesn’t always happen. Looking forward to going back for routine fringe trims and being a loyal customer ☺️ thank you!",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
