  {
   "name": "places/ChIJ1yI8ILyxe0gRBzw1ke3pKr4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pRM1VXUjJkR000TkRONGNuSTFiVEpvWlRKbWRHYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "After years of trying to find a proper good hairdressers, that not only does great hair but makes you feel good too, I think I’ve finally found it! ✨\n\nVox is such a nice salon, great interior, great vibe, and Senior Stylist, Nuala, who did my hair was a dream; she listened to exactly what I had in mind, told me what she thought would work best with my hair type and then gave me the best cut I’ve had in ages. I will absolutely be returning!",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
