  {
   "name": "places/ChIJ1yI8ILyxe0gRBzw1ke3pKr4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSVFFYSTJNRVV5TWtkcVdEbDJhMnBrVGpsV1pFRRAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
   "rating": 2,
   "text": {
    "text": "Had me waiting 20 minutes over my appointment time for me to walk upstairs the hairdresser take one look at my hair and go yeah I can't cut your hair because I'm an apprentice. Which fine I'd rather she tell me than just attempt it. But why wouldn't someone just tell me. My hair was a shortish bob and the options on their website were hair below ear level and hair above. Just annoying I was sat waiting and this should be clearer on their website. Luckily they gave me a refund and I was able to get my hair cut at The Studio instead. Disappointing!!",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
